sequenceDiagram
  participant CEX as CEX market stream
  participant Adapter as Binance adapter
  participant Workflow as Process-market-observation
  participant Domain as BUY policy
  participant Trading as Trading port
  participant State as Order/reservation state

  CEX->>Adapter: Last trade event
  Adapter->>Workflow: Canonical observation + source time
  Workflow->>State: Serialize market task / read current state
  Workflow->>Workflow: Validate freshness, gap and market readiness
  Workflow->>Domain: Evaluate standing BUY requirement
  Domain-->>Workflow: Exact BUY intent or refusal
  Workflow->>State: Check existing order + available funds
  Workflow->>Trading: Submit with stable client order ID
  Trading->>Adapter: Canonical order request
  Adapter->>CEX: Binance WebSocket API request
  CEX-->>Adapter: Ack / reject / unknown outcome
  Adapter-->>Workflow: Normalized result
  Note over Workflow,State: Acknowledgement is not an execution; fills update accounting separately